      {
        "id": 17323,
        "title": "Contagem regressiva",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146803,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Este loop <code>for</code> conta de <code>1</code> a <code>5</code>. Em jogos, frequentemente contamos para baixo também, como um temporizador de respawn. Altere-o para contar de <code>5</code> a <code>1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146804,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Primeiro, vamos mudar onde o loop começa definindo a variável de contagem para <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146805,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em seguida, vamos mudar a condição para que o loop <strong>pare</strong> quando <code>i</code> for maior que <code>0</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i</code> seguido de <code>&gt;</code> e finalmente <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em vez de incrementar a variável contador, nós a decrementamos com <code>i--</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i--</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146807,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para incluir <code>0</code> ao fazer a contagem regressiva (como mostrar <code>0</code> segundos restantes), usamos <code>&gt;=</code> em vez de <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146808,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que este loop não executa seu bloco de código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"-71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando o loop começa, o valor da variável contador é menor que <code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos dizer se o loop executa seu bloco de código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando o loop começa, o valor da variável contador é menor que <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146809,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que acontece quando usamos <code>i &gt; 0</code> na condição.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O loop continua enquanto <code>i</code> for maior que <code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O loop não funciona</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O loop continua enquanto <code>i</code> for maior que <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146810,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que este loop conta para baixo?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i--</code> está nos parênteses</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i++</code> está nos parênteses</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i--</code> está nos parênteses.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uma contagem regressiva de <code>5</code> a <code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma contagem regressiva de <code>5</code> a <code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uma contagem regressiva de <code>5</code> a <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie a variável de contador para que o loop for seja executado.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-5\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique <code>i &gt; 5</code> para que o loop execute quando <code>i</code> for maior que <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;High score bonus countdown:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i &gt; 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que a variável contador decremente cada vez que o loop se repita.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i++\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i += 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level starts in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i--</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para incluir <code>1</code> ao fazer a contagem regressiva, codifique a condição <code>i &gt;= 1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"22\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn in:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i &gt;= 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
